 are all about ZeroRank AI, praising its comprehensive AI visibility tracking, competitor benchmarking, and actionable recommendations. The detailed insights, responsive support, and ability to share dashboards with clients are big hits. There are a few hiccups like a learning curve and occasional glitches, just small bumps on the road. Weighing the raves against the occasional grumbles, ZeroRank AI is hitting the mark and is a solid buy for those in need of AI search visibility tracking. Given the 60-day money-back guarantee, it's worth giving ZeroRank AI a try.'","uses_codes":false,"uses_limited_licensing":false,"active_codes":0,"limited_licenses_quantity":0,"limited_licenses_remaining":0,"snippet_seo":"","badge":null,"quantity_remaining_below_threshold":0,"percent_claimed":-1,"story_details":{"value_prop":"Track and fix your AI search visibility","subheader":"Monitor AI citations, benchmark competitors, and get actionable recommendations to rank in AI search","header":"ZeroRank"},"plus_discount_price":62.1},{"id":255615,"deal_group_id":null,"media_url":"https://appsumo2-cdn.appsumo.com/media/deals/images/friday-code-as-Header-Friday_Code-16_9.png","product_logo":"https://appsumo2-cdn.appsumo.com/media/deals/images/Friday_Code_-_Icon_-_Dark.png","featured_image_url":"https://appsumo2-cdn.appsumo.com/media/deals/images/friday-code-as-Header-Friday_Code-16_9_fBr96JN.png","get_absolute_url":"/products/friday-code/","product_tags":[],"public_name":"Friday Code","card_description":"Build, deploy, and automate full-stack apps from a single desktop workspace with AI","slug":"friday-code","is_marketplace":false,"is_labs":false,"labs_type":"","browse_deal_status":"current","shows_codes_remaining":false,"codes_remaining":0,"has_started":true,"has_ended":false,"active_timer":false,"participation":["builder-stack-dotd-sept-2026"],"unique_plan_types":[["Lifetime Deal",null,null]],"story_images":[{"is_active":true,"alt_text":"Full stack development","slug":"Friday-Code-img-5d8a