able","Replit"],"best_for":["Product designers","Product managers","Founders"],"deal_type":["Software"],"product_tag":[],"subcategory":["App \u0026 Directory Builders"],"category":["Forms \u0026 App Builders"],"group":["Build \u0026 Code"]},"listing_type":"select","search_after":[0,1.7603372,1786973040087,1786973040087,255615],"rgb_background_color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","total_votes_count":0,"has_user_voted":false,"reviews_summary":"'Customers appreciate Friday Code for its intuitive and easy-to-use interface, robust AI capabilities, and the ability to build and deploy full-stack apps from a single desktop workspace. Some users have reported minor issues with credit transparency and occasional glitches. With an overall rating of 3.9 and a 60-day money-back guarantee, giving Friday Code a try seems like a solid choice for those in need of a powerful app-building tool. Additionally, Friday agents now use up to 40% less credits, with partial deduction of credits based on the tokens consumed, and image generation now at 50% reduced credits, offering improved credit optimization. New integrations in beta, such as NoCodeBackend and VEXP, provide enhanced functionalities. The ability to build and publish IOS apps with Expo integration and upcoming Android app publishing further enhance the platform's capabilities. The introduction of compact and full history mode, as well as the option to connect local LLMs with Friday, demonstrate the platform's commitment to continuous improvement and innovation.'","uses_codes":false,"uses_limited_licensing":false,"active_codes":0,"limited_licenses_quantity":0,"limited_licenses_remaining":0,"snippet_seo":"","badge":null,"quantity_remaining_below_threshold":0,"percent_claimed":-1,"story_details":{"value_prop":"Build full-stack apps with AI","subheader":"Build, deploy, and automate full-stack apps from a single desktop workspace with AI","header":"Friday Code"},"plus_discount_price":125.1},{"id":261487,"deal_group_id":690,"media_url":"https://ap